# The thinking map of the antigravity-cli AgentHarness (docs/adr/0040 §2):
# what a role's THINKING (low|medium|high, plan §5) becomes on the wire, at
# conformance.env's THINKING_PATH. entrypoint.sh passes it to agy as
# `--effort`, lower-cased: verified 2026-11-05 in the spike (Antigravity
# CLI 1.5.1, a scripted Gemini endpoint), `--effort low|medium|high`
# reaches the request as generationConfig.thinkingConfig.thinkingLevel
# LOW|MEDIUM|HIGH; `--effort xhigh` exits 1 on gemini-3.8-flash. The
# same values as gemini-cli's map, because both reach the same API.
GEMINI_LOW=LOW
GEMINI_MEDIUM=MEDIUM
GEMINI_HIGH=HIGH
